ELEMENTS
C H O AR
END
SPECIES
AR

O2 
OH HO2
!C5H10
!3-methyl-1-butene
!2-methyl-1-butene
!2-methyl-2-butene
!C5H11 (2MB  3MB  12DMP  11DMP)
2-methylbutyl  3-methylbutyl
1,2-dimethylpropyl  1,1-dimethylpropyl 
!C5H11O2 (RO2-pa  RO2-pb  RO2-s  RO2-t)
2-methylbutyloo  3-methylbutyloo
1,2-dimethylpropyloo  1,1-dimethylpropyloo

!----------------------------------------------------------------
!----- the species for O2 + 2MB -----
    
 	QOOH-pa1        ! 2-ethyl-3-hydroperoxyl-1-propyl
 	QOOH-pa2        ! 1-hydroperoxyl-2-methyl-2-butyl 
 	QOOH-pa3        ! 3-methyl-4-hydroperoxyl-2-butyl 
 	QOOH-pa4        ! 3-methyl-4-hydroperoxyl-1-butyl 

	Ppa2_frag       ! 3-ethyl-oxetane
	Ppa3_frag       ! formaldehyde + 1-butene
	Ppa6_frag       ! 2-methyl-2-ethyl-oxirane
	Ppa7_frag       ! 2-methyl-1-butene
	Ppa9_frag       ! 2,3-dimethyl-oxetane 
	Ppa10_frag      ! formaldehyde + 2-butene
	Ppa13_frag      ! 3-methyl-tetrahydrofuran
	Ppa15_frag      ! 2-methylbutanal
	
!----- the species for O2 + 3MB -----	

 	QOOH-pb1         ! 1-hydroperoxyl-3-methyl-2-butyl
 	QOOH-pb2         ! 2-methyl-4-hydroperoxyl-2-butyl 
 	QOOH-pb3         ! 2-methyl-4-hydroperoxyl-1-butyl 
                 
	Ppb2_frag        ! i-propyl-oxirane 
	Ppb3_frag        ! 3-methyl-1-butene
	Ppb5_frag        ! 2,2-dimethyl-oxetane
	Ppb6_frag        ! i-butene + formaldehyde
	Ppb9_frag        ! 3-methyl-tetrahydrofuran
	Ppb14_frag       ! 3-methyl-butanal
	
!----- the species for O2 + 12DMP -----	

 	QOOH-s1         ! 2-hydroperoxyl-3-methyl-1-butyl 
 	QOOH-s2         ! 2-methyl-3-hydroperoxyl-2-butyl
 	QOOH-s3         ! 2-methyl-3-hydroperoxyl-1-butyl 
                 
	Ps2_frag        ! i-propyl-oxirane 
	Ps3_frag        ! 3-methyl-1-butene 
	Ps5_frag        ! 2,2,3-trimethyl-oxirane 
	Ps6_frag        ! 2-methyl-2-butene 
	Ps8_frag        ! 2,3-dimethyl-oxetane
	Ps9_frag        ! acetaldehyde + propene 
	Ps15_frag       ! methyl i-propyl ketone
	
!----- the species for O2 + 11DMP -----	

 	QOOH-t1         ! 2-methyl-2-hydroperoxyl-1-butyl
 	QOOH-t2         ! 3-methyl-3-hydroperoxyl-1-butyl
 	QOOH-t3         ! 3-methyl-3-hydroperoxyl-2-butyl 
                 
	Pt2_frag        ! 2-methyl-2-ethyl-oxirane
	Pt3_frag        ! 2-methyl-1-butene  
	Pt5_frag        ! 2,2-dimethyl-oxetane 
	Pt6_frag        ! ethene + acetone 
	Pt9_frag        ! 2,2,3-trimethyl-oxirane 
	Pt10_frag       ! 2-methyl-2-butene 

END

REACTIONS	CAL/MOL	MOLES


